Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Source: OCR of hardcoded English subs ([1057] End of Wano 04 - Final Curtain.mp4); opening lyrics omitted}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.46,0:01:30.04,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Edited by fedew\NSubtitles by HatSubs
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.81,0:01:56.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The sky, dark and foreboding...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.74,0:02:09.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...as the storm intensifies!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.62,0:02:13.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Thank you for your purchase!\NA very fresh selection!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.58,0:02:17.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Across Onigashima...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.89,0:02:27.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...the Blue Dragon's bellow!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.02,0:02:33.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The mad howling of a legion of beasts!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.16,0:02:45.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,At the Port of Habu...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.79,0:02:51.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...the passing of a seasonal shower...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.29,0:02:57.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...dyes the leaves\Nof the maple in autumn's red!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.14,0:03:05.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is a tale of loyalty,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.93,0:03:12.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,of the retainers who risked it all\Nto avenge their lord, Kozuki Oden!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.52,0:03:18.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Though I may lack in eloquence...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.48,0:03:19.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.86,0:03:20.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Red Scabbards!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.53,0:03:28.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...I shall do my best\Nto recount the details.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.66,0:03:32.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now...!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.33,0:03:37.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Upon twilight of the day\Nof the Fire Festival,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.55,0:03:41.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,before a stormy, rain-filled night...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.97,0:03:45.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Leaving behind the\Nboisterous Flower Capital,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.22,0:03:45.72,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(1625,302)}Forest\Nleading to\NTokage Port\NUdon
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.39,0:03:51.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Momonosuke and his retinue make their way toward\NTokage Port, attempting to catch up to Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.73,0:03:53.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.06,0:03:55.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you not going out to sea, Yamato?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.98,0:03:59.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aye, I am not!\NI have already told Luffy and his crew!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.69,0:04:02.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So you are staying, Yamato.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.11,0:04:03.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Should I not?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.32,0:04:06.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nay, 'tis reassuring\Nto have you here...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.45,0:04:10.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But did you not say something about\Nmaking a decision earlier?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.66,0:04:12.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah, yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.08,0:04:15.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oden began by traveling\Nacross this country, did he not?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.67,0:04:17.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I know so little\Nof the world myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.84,0:04:20.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So I shall follow in his footsteps,\None day setting out to sea!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.88,0:04:22.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That is my decision!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.47,0:04:23.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.76,0:04:27.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy and his crew already\Ndiscussed this with you, Yamato?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.01,0:04:31.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This angers me all the more!\NThey dare mock me unto the end!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.68,0:04:35.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why do they depart without bidding\Neither me or Kin'emon farewell?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.69,0:04:36.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.44,0:04:41.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.91,0:04:50.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Your father was a fool of a lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.79,0:04:55.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who might you be,\Nand what business brings you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.83,0:04:59.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm Luffy.\NThe future Pirate King!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.50,0:05:01.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You, a samurai?!\NWhatta load!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.42,0:05:05.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm gonna be the Pirate King\None day, so there, knucklehead!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.30,0:05:11.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then I shall be Shogun of the\NLand of Wano one day, you buffoon!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.31,0:05:13.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whuzzat, ya slimy eel!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.93,0:05:15.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Arrogant monkey!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.56,0:05:16.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who ya callin' a monkey!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.10,0:05:20.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you just a puppet, Momo?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.03,0:05:26.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you gonna just cry?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.74,0:05:31.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I wish to fell Kaido!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.08,0:05:34.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's team up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.25,0:05:37.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,An alliance!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.29,0:05:39.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.80,0:05:44.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's right, Momo!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.63,0:05:46.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.72,0:05:50.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...just some topknotted runt,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.72,0:05:54.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,always bossin' people around\Neven though you're just a dumb scaredy-cat!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.56,0:05:56.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Do what ya gotta to stay alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.89,0:06:01.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna rescue you,\Nno matter what!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.32,0:06:04.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,'Cause we're pals!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.28,0:06:09.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll ask one more time, runt.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.74,0:06:11.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's your name?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.37,0:06:13.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hear my name!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.91,0:06:16.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kozuki Momonosuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.29,0:06:17.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I am...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.96,0:06:20.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...the future Shogun...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.88,0:06:26.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...of the Land of Wano!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.22,0:06:28.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Go, Momo!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.22,0:06:32.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You can fly!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.76,0:06:33.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aye!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.47,0:06:36.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Go stop...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.94,0:06:40.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...Onigashima!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.31,0:06:45.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,As for Kaido,\NI'm gonna...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.44,0:06:48.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...one hundred percent...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.90,0:06:51.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,beat him!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.37,0:06:56.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We may not be the best of friends,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.33,0:06:59.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but we journeyed together for so long,\Nand yet you feel nothing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.12,0:07:04.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How horrible you are!\NI thought you a better man than that, Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.38,0:07:08.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He confuses freedom with disrespect!\NAm I not right, Kin'emon?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.30,0:07:10.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You are most correct!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.80,0:07:14.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If I might inquire, Momonosuke-sama,\Nwhy do you not take flight?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.22,0:07:15.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Silence!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.97,0:07:18.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!\NI apologize for my rudeness!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.14,0:07:23.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You are the true Shogun of Wano now,\NMomonosuke-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.77,0:07:27.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Depending on Luffy-dono's response,\Nit is regretful, but we may have to cut him down!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.82,0:07:30.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Indeed! Such is\Nthe way of the samurai!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.49,0:07:33.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You said we were pals, Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.32,0:07:35.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You needn't be so angry...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.66,0:07:38.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He humiliated me!\NHe shall pay!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.83,0:07:41.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,First, I punch!\NThen, bite!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.25,0:07:43.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And then... Ah...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.46,0:07:46.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whatever the case,\NI will bring him to bear!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.96,0:07:48.96,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(1684,238)}Tokage\NPort\NUdon
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.92,0:07:54.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Next time I see you guys,\Nwe're total enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.55,0:07:56.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No complaints,\Nnot even if I murder you all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.18,0:07:58.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nope, won't hear any from me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.81,0:08:00.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bye, Traf!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.68,0:08:01.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shuddup.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.77,0:08:02.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whuuuuh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.98,0:08:04.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Later, Jaggy!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.94,0:08:06.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're next in line\Nto be ground meat.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.90,0:08:09.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shove off and ship out!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.41,0:08:16.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.21,0:08:27.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You lot, there!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.25,0:08:29.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait one moment!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.80,0:08:33.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! We came to send you off!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.47,0:08:35.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Momonosuke, Kin'emon!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.97,0:08:37.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yamato-chwan!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.31,0:08:42.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.77,0:08:43.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Uweeeh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.60,0:08:45.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I have you now!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.44,0:08:46.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.60,0:08:47.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.23,0:08:49.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.69,0:08:53.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What are you thinking?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.15,0:08:57.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Leaving without a word to us,\Nwe who have known you for longer than any other!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.07,0:08:57.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Heeh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.37,0:09:01.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You have incensed the Shogun and myself!\NExplain yourself at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.91,0:09:03.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, we're meetin' now, ain't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.79,0:09:06.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.37,0:09:08.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,By order of the Shogun...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.71,0:09:10.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,W-Whaddya want?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.59,0:09:19.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dod't go!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.35,0:09:20.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll mizz you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.10,0:09:27.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pweaze, stay with me! Forevuh!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.65,0:09:32.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I do not want to be\Nseparated from you all!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.33,0:09:52.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You were the very reasons...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.92,0:09:54.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...for my continued existence!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.21,0:09:57.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You were the very reasons...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.51,0:09:59.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...I was able to smile!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.51,0:10:04.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I thank you for avenging...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.89,0:10:07.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...my father and mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.94,0:10:13.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I am weak of mind,\Nand cannot find the words...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.94,0:10:16.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But, I fear what is to come!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.32,0:10:18.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So please, do not go!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.24,0:10:21.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kinda pathetic, huh...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.07,0:10:24.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Momo-chan's still just a child...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.20,0:10:28.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Usopp!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.42,0:10:31.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gotcha, it's all set!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.17,0:10:32.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Catch!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.38,0:10:39.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We were standin' by on the Sunny\Nso we could hand this over to ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.22,0:10:41.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Some "Shogun" you are, Momo!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.68,0:10:45.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You might be bigger in size,\Nbut we know who ya are on the inside!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.06,0:10:48.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yer just a stupid dumbhead scaredy-cat!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.61,0:10:53.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.32,0:10:56.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...I think of ya\Nas my little brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.74,0:11:02.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.49,0:11:04.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A flag?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.12,0:11:08.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,When the times get tough,\Njust remember our adventure on the seas!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.16,0:11:10.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,An' fly this over Wano!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.08,0:11:14.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If trouble comes knockin',\Njust flash this at 'em!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.71,0:11:21.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If someone picks a fight with one of us,\Nthey're pickin' a fight with all of us!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.39,0:11:26.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"One of us"?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.18,0:11:28.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You mean, I am one of you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.53,0:11:45.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kin'emon, Yamato...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.95,0:11:47.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Momo!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.62,0:11:53.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If yous wanna be pirates,\Nwe'll come by to pick ya up anytime!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.00,0:11:54.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And no wimps allowed!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.88,0:12:05.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Set sail!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.47,0:12:07.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Steady as she goes!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.66,0:12:30.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm counting on you, Yamato!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.12,0:12:33.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Later!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.41,0:12:35.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All the best!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.58,0:12:36.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aye!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.58,0:12:38.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hang in there, Shogun!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.88,0:12:41.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Good luck, Momonosuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.05,0:12:43.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No sobbin' from now on!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.09,0:12:48.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Look after yourselves!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.72,0:12:50.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We'll meet again!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.39,0:12:52.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Take care!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.84,0:13:26.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kin'emon?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.93,0:13:27.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes, m' lord?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.59,0:13:32.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I shall surpass Kozuki Oden someday!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.69,0:13:38.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And I shall see it through!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.65,0:13:39.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Surpass me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.56,0:13:40.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No, not you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.86,0:13:49.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay...\NTo Hakumai!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.82,0:13:54.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I was told there's an official port\Nwith a lift to lower ships.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.54,0:13:56.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.96,0:14:00.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Having climbed a waterfall to get here,\NI thought we would also be plunging off!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.01,0:14:08.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah! Straw Hat and Trafalgar...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.84,0:14:12.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Usin' the official port, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.22,0:14:18.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Somethin' regular-ass pirates\Nlike you oughta use!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.39,0:14:22.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,'Cause after all,\Nit's nice 'n harmless!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.78,0:14:26.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Harm...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.86,0:14:27.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...less?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.82,0:14:30.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Perfect for followers like you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.12,0:14:33.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Follow...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.70,0:14:34.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...ers?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.87,0:14:36.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No, don't, Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.08,0:14:38.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Harmless is good!\NDon't take the bait!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.75,0:14:41.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?\NCaptain, why're you makin' that face?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.17,0:14:43.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Using the official port's totally okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.42,0:14:44.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shaddup and just follow me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.80,0:14:45.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.67,0:14:46.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You don't got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.67,0:14:48.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stop the Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.22,0:14:49.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Jinbe, lemme take the helm!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.84,0:14:51.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't do it, Luffyyyy!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.47,0:14:53.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Captain, just don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.99,0:15:14.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The fellow rebels that Momonosuke-sama\Nand Kin'emon brought in tow...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.49,0:15:18.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,As though they were\Nthe true Wisdom Kings,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.37,0:15:22.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,they raged on like typhoons!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.17,0:15:25.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Neither the Dragon King, Kaido,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.88,0:15:29.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,nor the monstrous oiran-fiend,\Ncould match their fury!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.05,0:15:32.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Their death throes\Nrent the sky asunder!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.47,0:15:41.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Meanwhile, there was Orochi,\Nthought to have burned to death!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.27,0:15:48.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Out of spite, he threw himself\Nupon the Princess Hiyori!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.99,0:15:52.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Slash!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.07,0:15:58.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And just like that, with a single swipe of the blade,\Nsomeone cut him down...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.24,0:16:03.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,'Twas none other than\NKozuki Oden's second disciple, Denjiro!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.29,0:16:06.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And so, Orochi's remaining head\Nwas set ablaze!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.42,0:16:11.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Such was the end\Nof Kurozumi Orochi!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.80,0:16:15.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Much like the rumbling of thunder,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.64,0:16:19.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,so fell Onigashima\Nand the Dragon King, Kaido!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.35,0:16:22.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The dark clouds...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.48,0:16:27.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...cast across the skies of\Nthe Land of Wano for some twenty-odd years...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.65,0:16:29.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...ever so...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.19,0:16:33.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...slowly clear away.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.95,0:16:42.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,With the sounds of the Flower Capital's\Nfestival music in the distance...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.54,0:16:47.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Roll!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.67,0:16:52.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Burning like mad,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.80,0:16:57.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Orochi, ever-glaring\Nin our direction, said this:
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.14,0:17:03.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"The Kurozumi Clan's grudge...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.89,0:17:12.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...will curse this country\Nfor generations to come!"
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.19,0:17:18.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,One could see the twenty years\Nof Wano's suffering in Princess Hiyori's eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.24,0:17:20.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then, her gaze of steadfastness!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.66,0:17:22.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"'Tis dangerous, Hiyori-sama!"
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.29,0:17:26.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Cried Denjiro the samurai,\Nbut she brushed him aside.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.17,0:17:31.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Our beloved Princess Hiyori gave not\Nany quarter to the burning Orochi!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.38,0:17:33.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Instead, she spoke to him his requiem!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.59,0:17:36.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fan in hand...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.55,0:17:38.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...bearing the Kozuki family crest.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.09,0:17:41.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She bit upon her lip,\Nrecalling the twenty years of anguish.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.76,0:17:44.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"O Father, O Mother, O Brother..."
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.56,0:17:48.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And she thought\Nof her homeland, and said!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.10,0:17:48.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.73,0:17:49.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I've been waiting for this!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.77,0:17:53.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come, dear audience!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.74,0:17:58.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"If it does not burn...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.41,0:18:02.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"...then it is not charcoal!"
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.00,0:18:19.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Upon twilight of the day\Nof the Fire Festival.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.51,0:18:28.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The "Reversed Crescent Moon,"\Nmarking the port of rendezvous
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.40,0:18:36.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,'Tis a tale of the bloody battles...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.78,0:18:40.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...to take revenge, to rebuild a clan...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.61,0:18:52.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...that shall be passed down\Nfor generations to come!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.59,0:19:00.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Such is the tale of...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.09,0:19:04.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...the return of these\Nlegendary samurai!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.31,0:19:09.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My time here today\Nis just about at its end!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.64,0:19:10.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Momonosuke-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.94,0:19:12.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you might permit me\Npause for today...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.14,0:19:13.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Shogun-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.52,0:19:15.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I hope that we...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.32,0:19:19.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...might meet again!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.61,0:19:21.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where shall we fly the flag?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.17,0:19:37.17,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(986,474)}The\NEnd
